{"kind":"request","text":"G1 of the Git host choice note (notes/2026-10-27-git-host-choice.md, section 10; landed 053c5595): host `none`. Child of the load findings a6847815 (item 6) and the launchd and HTTPS findings e6a5cd22 (item 6, room creation without the demo offer). A deployment off Cloudflare cannot create a room today because creation admission pins the register from ARTIFACTS_CONFIG (apps/room/creation-admission.ts; packages/scope/src/creation-admission.ts:24).\n\nWhat:\n1. `dap install --host none|artifacts|github.com`, required, closed list; `host-unknown` for other text; `host-unavailable` for artifacts where the binding is absent (note section 3). A host-`none` register records the empty namespace; `found` sends create-directory at once with no repository record.\n2. The register, directory and destination versions of section 9 (UNPUBLISHED_COHORT register@21, directory@20, destination@16, with membership@8, rules@10, inbox@1), the refusal table of section 4 with reason `no-repository`, the \"keeps working\" list, the shortened wait, the page and `dap status` wording, the site route.\n3. The register pin becomes host-independent: one nonsecret setting `REGISTER_SCOPE` (the scope id string) read through the one accessor that creation admission and the census use (artifactsRegisterScope today, renamed as you see fit). ARTIFACTS_CONFIG keeps its registerScope for the artifacts host; where both are set they must be equal or the deployment refuses creation `misconfigured`. Every deployed config gains the setting; the planner edits the three wrangler configs in the head's review and deploys.\n4. The page's Start on a deployment with no DEMO_START_CONFIG shows the CLI instruction and never calls /v1/demo/creation-offer (today it needs that route, which a self-hosted deployment does not serve).\n\nWitnesses: W1 to W3 of the note (a room under a host-`none` register on the test Worker with every \"keeps working\" act taken, every repository act refused `no-repository`, none pending, one `publish-file` delivery from an installed application answered refused with the sending act's outcome final; `--host other` refused host-unknown and `--host artifacts` refused host-unavailable; `dap verify --all` consistent), plus W4: creation admitted on a deployment with REGISTER_SCOPE and no ARTIFACTS_CONFIG, and refused where neither is set; W5: the page on that deployment shows the instruction and makes no creation-offer request.\n\nOne gate, exact-head review, PD-2 note and manifest. Order: after the census f51f16f4; before H1 (99918e60, amended today). The planner deploys and files the first host-`none` room on the test Worker.","body":{"conditions":"Host none as the note's section 10 G1 with items 1 to 4 here; witnesses W1 to W5; one gate at the exact head; PD-2 note and manifest; checker approval; landed on main; the planner deploys and files the first host-none room.","target_head":"ca7b16bc9a297912a065ca97773b510f6f14dcdc","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_repo":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}